# Dawnless Dunes — fallen crystal, black pyramid and upper balcony

<a id="dawnless-dunes--fallen-crystal-black-pyramid-and-upper-balcony-s3e11"></a>

## Introduction

Beyond the triangle gate lies a vast underground desert of black sand. No natural wind stirs its ruined streets and courtyards. A fallen obelisk projects from a dune near a shattered blue crystal, while a black pyramid rises beyond the old city's remains. The silence and deep sand make the approach slow and exposed.[^desert]

## Development

<a id="post-campaign-kyle-reveal-unactivated-khalazar-statue--alternate-giant-iron-golem-fight"></a>
<a id="s3e12-final-two-rescues-khalazar-death-palace-collapse"></a>
